# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Graphify Ignore Overrides
# Memastikan direktori knowledge/ tetap diindeks ke dalam Graf Pengetahuan
# meskipun knowledge/ di-ignore pada .gitignore untuk push Git.
# Root docs AGENTS/CLAUDE/GEMINI juga di-re-include:
# mereka di-gitignore agar tidak ter-push, tetapi tetap bagian dari korpus lokal.
# Secrets (.env, *.pem, credentials) dan artefak build TIDAK di-re-include.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!knowledge/
!knowledge/**
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!GEMINI.md

# Vendored minified library: its mangled symbols (n, T, me) pollute the graph.
crates/web/tests/a11y/axe.min.js

# Owner token of the GBrain source; never index it.
knowledge/.gbrain-owner.json
.claude/

# Generated or binary assets with nothing to extract: launcher icons, Tauri
# schemas, visual goldens, font licenses.
apps/tauri/icons/
apps/tauri/gen/android/app/src/main/res/
apps/tauri/gen/schemas/
crates/web/tests/visual/test_visual.py-snapshots/
crates/web/fonts/
